{"seq":1,"slug":"transformer-music","title":"Transformer 音乐生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models/transformer-music","wordCount":1477,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"transformer-音乐生成\">Transformer 音乐生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Transformer 把音乐当成&quot;语言&quot;来生成，理解它需要抓住四个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自回归建模</strong>：用链式条件概率逐步预测下一个 Token，天然贴合音乐的时序展开。</li>\n<li><strong>相对位置更重要</strong>：Music Transformer 用相对位置编码关注事件之间的&quot;距离&quot;，比绝对位置更契合音程与节奏。</li>\n<li><strong>多轨需压缩上下文</strong>：交错、分层、延迟模式等策略把并行声部压进可控长度的序列。</li>\n<li><strong>采样策略决定质量</strong>：温度、Top-k/Top-p 与 CFG 的取值在&quot;创造性&quot;与&quot;合理性&quot;之间取得平衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四个要点共同回答了&quot;如何建模音乐分布、如何感知结构、如何处理多声部、如何采样出好音乐&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自回归音乐建模\">自回归音乐建模</h2><p>Transformer 在音乐生成中的应用延续了语言模型的自回归范式——将音乐 Token 序列视为&quot;语言&quot;，通过最大化下一个 Token 的条件概率来建模音乐分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\mathbf{x}) = \\prod_{i=1}^{N} P(x_i \\mid x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_{i-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种逐步生成的方式天然适合音乐的时序性——音乐是在时间中展开的艺术，每个新事件都依赖于前序上下文。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>组织</th>\n<th>输入表示</th>\n<th>上下文长度</th>\n<th>关键创新</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Music Transformer</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>MIDI events</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>Relative attention</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MuseNet</td>\n<td>OpenAI</td>\n<td>MIDI events</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>GPT-2 架构复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MusicGen</td>\n<td>Meta</td>\n<td>Audio codec</td>\n<td>30s</td>\n<td>Delay pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MusicLM</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>Audio tokens</td>\n<td>30s</td>\n<td>层级生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jukebox</td>\n<td>OpenAI</td>\n<td>VQ-VAE codes</td>\n<td>24s</td>\n<td>超大规模/歌词条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 训练[&quot;训练阶段&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;音乐数据集&lt;br/&gt;MIDI/Audio&quot;]&#10;        TK[&quot;Token化&lt;br/&gt;词表映射&quot;]&#10;        TR[&quot;Transformer训练&lt;br/&gt;Next-Token Prediction&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 生成[&quot;生成阶段&quot;]&#10;        PR[&quot;Prompt&lt;br/&gt;起始序列&quot;]&#10;        AR[&quot;自回归采样&lt;br/&gt;逐Token生成&quot;]&#10;        DT[&quot;解Token化&lt;br/&gt;恢复音乐&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 控制[&quot;生成控制&quot;]&#10;        TP[&quot;Temperature&lt;br/&gt;随机性&quot;]&#10;        TK2[&quot;Top-k/Top-p&lt;br/&gt;截断采样&quot;]&#10;        CF[&quot;CFG&lt;br/&gt;条件强度&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    D --&gt; TK --&gt; TR&#10;    PR --&gt; AR --&gt; DT&#10;    TP --&gt; AR&#10;    TK2 --&gt; AR&#10;    CF --&gt; AR\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 训练[\"训练阶段\"]\n        D[\"音乐数据集&lt;br/&gt;MIDI/Audio\"]\n        TK[\"Token化&lt;br/&gt;词表映射\"]\n        TR[\"Transformer训练&lt;br/&gt;Next-Token Prediction\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 生成[\"生成阶段\"]\n        PR[\"Prompt&lt;br/&gt;起始序列\"]\n        AR[\"自回归采样&lt;br/&gt;逐Token生成\"]\n        DT[\"解Token化&lt;br/&gt;恢复音乐\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 控制[\"生成控制\"]\n        TP[\"Temperature&lt;br/&gt;随机性\"]\n        TK2[\"Top-k/Top-p&lt;br/&gt;截断采样\"]\n        CF[\"CFG&lt;br/&gt;条件强度\"]\n    end\n    D --&gt; TK --&gt; TR\n    PR --&gt; AR --&gt; DT\n    TP --&gt; AR\n    TK2 --&gt; AR\n    CF --&gt; AR</pre><h2 id=\"相对位置编码与长程结构\">相对位置编码与长程结构</h2><p>音乐中的相对关系（音程、节奏比例）比绝对位置更重要。Music Transformer 的核心贡献是用相对位置编码（Relative Positional Encoding）替代绝对位置，使模型关注事件之间的&quot;距离&quot;而非&quot;位置&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Attention</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msup></mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Attention}(Q, K, V) = \\text{softmax}\\left(\\frac{QK^T + S^{\\text{rel}}}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right) V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attention</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4761em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2528em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mtext>rel</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>where </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> is relative position embedding</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^{\\text{rel}}_{ij} = Q_i \\cdot R_{j-i} \\quad \\text{where } R_k \\text{ is relative position embedding}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">where </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> is relative position embedding</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置编码方式</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>音乐优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绝对位置 (Sinusoidal)</td>\n<td>每位置固定向量</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>不泛化到训练外长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对位置 (Shaw/Music Transformer)</td>\n<td>编码距离</td>\n<td>平移不变</td>\n<td>内存开销大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RoPE</td>\n<td>旋转编码相对距离</td>\n<td>高效/可外推</td>\n<td>需适配音乐结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALiBi</td>\n<td>线性距离偏置</td>\n<td>零额外参数</td>\n<td>可能忽略远程同类事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 绝对[&quot;绝对位置编码&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;pos=1: 固定向量&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;pos=2: 固定向量&quot;]&#10;        A3[&quot;pos=100: 固定向量&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 相对[&quot;相对位置编码&quot;]&#10;        R1[&quot;dist=0: 同位置&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;dist=1: 相邻&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;dist=4: 一小节&quot;]&#10;        R4[&quot;dist=16: 一个乐句&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 音乐意义[&quot;音乐意义&quot;]&#10;        M1[&quot;相邻音符关系&lt;br/&gt;旋律连接&quot;]&#10;        M2[&quot;小节内对齐&lt;br/&gt;节拍结构&quot;]&#10;        M3[&quot;乐句间呼应&lt;br/&gt;ABA结构&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    R2 --&gt; M1&#10;    R3 --&gt; M2&#10;    R4 --&gt; M3\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 绝对[\"绝对位置编码\"]\n        A1[\"pos=1: 固定向量\"]\n        A2[\"pos=2: 固定向量\"]\n        A3[\"pos=100: 固定向量\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 相对[\"相对位置编码\"]\n        R1[\"dist=0: 同位置\"]\n        R2[\"dist=1: 相邻\"]\n        R3[\"dist=4: 一小节\"]\n        R4[\"dist=16: 一个乐句\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 音乐意义[\"音乐意义\"]\n        M1[\"相邻音符关系&lt;br/&gt;旋律连接\"]\n        M2[\"小节内对齐&lt;br/&gt;节拍结构\"]\n        M3[\"乐句间呼应&lt;br/&gt;ABA结构\"]\n    end\n    R2 --&gt; M1\n    R3 --&gt; M2\n    R4 --&gt; M3</pre><h2 id=\"多轨与多层生成策略\">多轨与多层生成策略</h2><p>音乐通常包含多个并行的声部/轨道，直接将所有轨道展开为单一序列会导致上下文长度爆炸。解决方案包括交错排列和分层生成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Interleaved</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mtext>drum</mtext></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mtext>bass</mtext></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mtext>mel</mtext></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mtext>drum</mtext></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mtext>bass</mtext></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Interleaved}: [t_1^{\\text{drum}}, t_1^{\\text{bass}}, t_1^{\\text{mel}}, t_2^{\\text{drum}}, t_2^{\\text{bass}}, \\ldots]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Interleaved</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">drum</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">drum</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Hierarchical</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Structure</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Melody</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Harmony</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Arrangement</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Hierarchical}: \\text{Structure} \\to \\text{Melody} \\to \\text{Harmony} \\to \\text{Arrangement}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hierarchical</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Structure</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Melody</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Harmony</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Arrangement</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单序列交错</td>\n<td>多轨Token按时间交错</td>\n<td>全局注意力/跨轨学习</td>\n<td>序列极长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层级联</td>\n<td>先粗后细逐层细化</td>\n<td>结构一致性好</td>\n<td>层间错误传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行生成</td>\n<td>多轨同时生成</td>\n<td>快速/独立性强</td>\n<td>轨间协调弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟模式</td>\n<td>不同码本层错位生成</td>\n<td>平衡效率和质量</td>\n<td>MusicGen专用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 延迟模式[&quot;MusicGen 延迟模式&quot;]&#10;        subgraph 时间步[&quot;时间步 t=1,2,3,4,5&quot;]&#10;            T1[&quot;t=1&quot;]&#10;            T2[&quot;t=2&quot;]&#10;            T3[&quot;t=3&quot;]&#10;            T4[&quot;t=4&quot;]&#10;            T5[&quot;t=5&quot;]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph 码本层[&quot;码本层&quot;]&#10;            L1[&quot;Layer1: c1_1, c1_2, c1_3, c1_4, c1_5&quot;]&#10;            L2[&quot;Layer2: ____, c2_1, c2_2, c2_3, c2_4&quot;]&#10;            L3[&quot;Layer3: ____, ____, c3_1, c3_2, c3_3&quot;]&#10;            L4[&quot;Layer4: ____, ____, ____, c4_1, c4_2&quot;]&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 意义[&quot;设计意义&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;每步生成一个Token&lt;br/&gt;覆盖所有层但有延迟&lt;br/&gt;单模型处理多码本&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    延迟模式 --&gt; 意义\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 延迟模式[\"MusicGen 延迟模式\"]\n        subgraph 时间步[\"时间步 t=1,2,3,4,5\"]\n            T1[\"t=1\"]\n            T2[\"t=2\"]\n            T3[\"t=3\"]\n            T4[\"t=4\"]\n            T5[\"t=5\"]\n        end\n        subgraph 码本层[\"码本层\"]\n            L1[\"Layer1: c1_1, c1_2, c1_3, c1_4, c1_5\"]\n            L2[\"Layer2: ____, c2_1, c2_2, c2_3, c2_4\"]\n            L3[\"Layer3: ____, ____, c3_1, c3_2, c3_3\"]\n            L4[\"Layer4: ____, ____, ____, c4_1, c4_2\"]\n        end\n    end\n    subgraph 意义[\"设计意义\"]\n        S[\"每步生成一个Token&lt;br/&gt;覆盖所有层但有延迟&lt;br/&gt;单模型处理多码本\"]\n    end\n    延迟模式 --&gt; 意义</pre><p>MusicGen 的 Delay Pattern 是关键创新：将多层 RVQ 码本通过延迟排列转化为单一序列生成问题，每个时间步只需预测一个 Token，但不同层之间有固定偏移。这避免了需要 N 个独立模型或 N 次解码的低效方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长上下文与结构一致性\">长上下文与结构一致性</h2><p>音乐的结构性远超自然语言——一首 4 分钟的流行歌有明确的 Intro-Verse-Chorus-Bridge 结构，重复的动机和主题需要跨越数千个 Token 保持一致。这对 Transformer 的长程依赖建模提出极高要求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Context Window Need</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Song Length</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Tokens/sec</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>240</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12000</mn><mtext> tokens</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Context Window Need} = \\text{Song Length} \\times \\text{Tokens/sec} \\approx 240s \\times 50 = 12000 \\text{ tokens}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Context Window Need</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Song Length</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tokens/sec</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">240</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> tokens</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术方案</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>最大有效上下文</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增大窗口</td>\n<td>直接扩展位置编码</td>\n<td>8K–32K tokens</td>\n<td>GPT-4 style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆机制</td>\n<td>外部记忆存储远程信息</td>\n<td>理论无限</td>\n<td>Memorizing Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段递归</td>\n<td>段间传递隐状态</td>\n<td>跨段有效</td>\n<td>Transformer-XL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏注意力</td>\n<td>只关注关键位置</td>\n<td>更大窗口</td>\n<td>Longformer/BigBird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级规划</td>\n<td>先生成结构再填充</td>\n<td>全曲一致</td>\n<td>SongComposer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 层级生成[&quot;层级结构生成&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;Song Structure&lt;br/&gt;AABA, 4 sections&quot;]&#10;        CH[&quot;Chord Progression&lt;br/&gt;每小节和弦&quot;]&#10;        ML[&quot;Melody&lt;br/&gt;具体音符&quot;]&#10;        AR[&quot;Arrangement&lt;br/&gt;多轨编排&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    S --&gt; CH --&gt; ML --&gt; AR\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 层级生成[\"层级结构生成\"]\n        S[\"Song Structure&lt;br/&gt;AABA, 4 sections\"]\n        CH[\"Chord Progression&lt;br/&gt;每小节和弦\"]\n        ML[\"Melody&lt;br/&gt;具体音符\"]\n        AR[\"Arrangement&lt;br/&gt;多轨编排\"]\n    end\n    S --&gt; CH --&gt; ML --&gt; AR</pre><p>结构一致性是当前AI音乐生成的最大瓶颈之一——模型能生成局部悦耳的音乐，但常常在宏观层面缺乏连贯的发展逻辑和适时的回归呼应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采样策略与生成质量\">采样策略与生成质量</h2><p>生成时的采样策略对最终音乐质量影响巨大——温度过高导致混乱、过低导致重复。音乐生成需要在&quot;创造性&quot;和&quot;合理性&quot;之间找到平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>adjusted</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>temperature</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{adjusted}}(x_i) = \\frac{\\exp(z_i / \\tau)}{\\sum_j \\exp(z_j / \\tau)}, \\quad \\tau = \\text{temperature}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adjusted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5488em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">temperature</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样参数</th>\n<th>低值效果</th>\n<th>高值效果</th>\n<th>音乐推荐范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Temperature</td>\n<td>保守/重复</td>\n<td>激进/混乱</td>\n<td>0.8–1.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Top-k</td>\n<td>极少选择</td>\n<td>多样但可能不合理</td>\n<td>50–250</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Top-p (nucleus)</td>\n<td>集中高概率</td>\n<td>允许长尾</td>\n<td>0.9–0.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CFG Scale</td>\n<td>弱条件引导</td>\n<td>强条件引导</td>\n<td>3.0–5.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repetition Penalty</td>\n<td>允许重复</td>\n<td>惩罚重复</td>\n<td>1.1–1.3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合理的策略组合是：Temperature=0.9 + Top-p=0.92 + 适度 Repetition Penalty——既保持创造性，又避免跑调或陷入重复。不同音乐类型（古典 vs 电子）可能需要不同的参数配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Transformer 用自回归范式把音乐 Token 序列当作语言来建模。</li>\n<li>相对位置编码关注事件间距，更符合音乐中音程与节奏的相对性。</li>\n<li>多轨生成依赖交错、分层或延迟模式，平衡上下文长度与跨轨协调。</li>\n<li>长程结构一致性是当前最大瓶颈，增大窗口、记忆、分段递归各有取舍。</li>\n<li>采样参数（温度、Top-k/p、CFG）直接决定生成质量，需按音乐类型调校。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Transformer 音乐生成","id":"transformer-音乐生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自回归音乐建模","id":"自回归音乐建模"},{"level":2,"text":"相对位置编码与长程结构","id":"相对位置编码与长程结构"},{"level":2,"text":"多轨与多层生成策略","id":"多轨与多层生成策略"},{"level":2,"text":"长上下文与结构一致性","id":"长上下文与结构一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"采样策略与生成质量","id":"采样策略与生成质量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"音乐 Token 化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/tokenization"},"next":{"title":"扩散模型音频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models/diffusion-audio"}}